# Git

## Commit messages

Conventional format:

```
feat: add team ranking widget
fix: preserve classroom on page navigation
chore: update dependencies
```

Types: `feat`, `fix`, `refactor`, `docs`, `test`, `chore`, `perf`, `ci`

## Safety

- Do not commit unless the user explicitly asks
- Do not push unless the user explicitly asks
- Do not use `--no-verify` or skip hooks unless the user asks
- Never commit secrets (`.env`, API keys, tokens)

## Pull requests

When creating PRs: summarize full branch diff, include test plan checklist.
